{
  "name": "CRM Marketing · Social publish",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "5daf7fef-61aa-38ac-2526-7bc5f2fcb322",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CRM → n8n: social publish\nReceives `marketing.social.publish/v1` packages from the CRM dispatcher at `POST /webhook/social-publish`, verifies the HMAC signature, answers **202** immediately, publishes to Facebook / Instagram / TikTok, then calls the CRM back with a signed `post.published` or `post.failed` event.\n\nThe CRM only sends ADMIN-approved, safeguard-checked posts. See `n8n-workflows/README.md`.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 240
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8dccd29c-f5de-3b44-424c-0251238bd131",
      "name": "CRM webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "06770c0c-9e16-e512-221b-2ca40d46b3e7",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "social-publish",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "rawBody": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b6ea35de-d3d7-6ca3-70a3-8396e7e60870",
      "name": "Verify CRM signature",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Verifies the CRM's HMAC signature (MARKETING_N8N_OUTBOUND_SECRET) over the RAW body:\n// signature = \"sha256=\" + hex(HMAC_SHA256(secret, timestamp + \".\" + rawBody)), 5-minute window.\n// Also enforces the payload schema, matches x-mkt-job-id, and dedupes on the Idempotency-Key.\nconst crypto = require('crypto');\nconst secret = $env.MARKETING_N8N_OUTBOUND_SECRET;\nconst item = $input.first();\nconst headers = item.json.headers || {};\nconst fail = (status, reason) => [{ json: { ok: false, status, reason } }];\n\nlet raw;\ntry {\n  raw = (await this.helpers.getBinaryDataBuffer(0, 'data')).toString('utf8');\n} catch (e) {\n  // Webhook \"Raw Body\" disabled: the CRM sends canonical JSON, which re-serializes identically.\n  raw = JSON.stringify(item.json.body);\n}\n\nif (!secret || secret.length < 32) return fail(500, 'MARKETING_N8N_OUTBOUND_SECRET is not set on n8n');\nconst ts = headers['x-mkt-timestamp'];\nconst sig = headers['x-mkt-signature'];\nif (!ts || !sig) return fail(401, 'missing signature headers');\nif (!/^\\d{1,12}$/.test(ts) || Math.abs(Date.now() / 1000 - Number(ts)) > 300) return fail(401, 'stale or invalid timestamp');\nconst expected = 'sha256=' + crypto.createHmac('sha256', secret).update(ts + '.' + raw).digest('hex');\nconst a = Buffer.from(String(sig));\nconst b = Buffer.from(expected);\nif (a.length !== b.length || !crypto.timingSafeEqual(a, b)) return fail(401, 'bad signature');\n\nlet pkg;\ntry {\n  pkg = JSON.parse(raw);\n} catch (e) {\n  return fail(400, 'body is not JSON');\n}\nif (pkg.schema !== 'marketing.social.publish/v1') return fail(400, 'unexpected schema ' + pkg.schema);\nif (headers['x-mkt-job-id'] && headers['x-mkt-job-id'] !== pkg.jobId) return fail(400, 'job id header does not match body');\n\n// At-least-once delivery from the CRM: answer 409 for a job we already accepted\n// (the CRM treats 409 as delivered). Static data persists for ACTIVE workflows.\nconst store = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nstore.jobs = store.jobs || {};\nconst key = headers['idempotency-key'] || pkg.jobId;\nif (store.jobs[key]) return fail(409, 'duplicate job ' + key);\nstore.jobs[key] = Date.now();\nconst keys = Object.keys(store.jobs);\nif (keys.length > 1000) keys.sort((x, y) => store.jobs[x] - store.jobs[y]).slice(0, keys.length - 1000).forEach((k) => delete store.jobs[k]);\n\nreturn [{ json: { ok: true, jobId: pkg.jobId, pkg } }];"
      }
    },
